+//
+// The official generator never copies the account-concurrency family into the
+// provider-gateway collection: build_provider_gateway_collection_for_profile
+// starts from new_empty_local_access_collection() and
+// apply_provider_gateway_template_settings copies 19 unrelated fields, so the
